 "notes": "All five planned kinds kept; Glockenspiel added (new, sourced). Old Marimba One models became versions; Ludwig Grand Symphonic/Professional became versions of the balanced-action archetype (the Grand Symphonic maker page returned 403, so no specs); Yamaha timpani series kept in m, duplicate r list dropped. Generic Musser/Yamaha/Adams marimba entries kept in m without model names because no model page was retrieved. No years given where pages lacked them (Musser founding, M55 introduction, balanced-action invention year). No traditions: Guatemalan marimba and African xylophones are covered as archetypes; a tradition entry could be added by the world-percussion shelf."
